      "content": "It is deeply understandable that you feel a profound challenge to the idea of meaning when life feels random. The struggle you're describing is a very deep and difficult existential pain, and it is a heavy burden to carry alone. Please know that even if the \"why\" of life feels missing, the \"here and now\" pain is real and treatable. If you feel ready, please let a professional help you explore these intense feelings of meaning and worth.",
